<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Experience & Education — Muhammad Julda Al Hafiz</title><meta name="description" content="Pengalaman Kerja, Pendidikan, dan Rekam Jejak Organisasi Muhammad Julda Al Hafiz"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"></head><body><%- include('partials/navbar') %><main><section class="hero"><div class="container"><div class="kicker">Career Journey</div><h1>Pengalaman Kerja & Rekam Jejak</h1><p class="lead">Pengalaman praktis mengelola proses Human Resources dari hulu ke hilir pada industri manufaktur & distribusi, dengan spesialisasi rekrutmen end-to-end, payroll 100+ karyawan, administrasi ketenagakerjaan, serta General Affairs.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="kicker">Work History</div><h2>Pengalaman Kerja Profesional</h2><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:28px"><% experiences.forEach(e=>{ %><article class="card" style="padding:32px"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:8px"><h3 style="margin:0;font-size:26px"><%= e.role %></h3><span class="meta" style="font-size:13px"><%= e.period %></span></div><p style="font-size:18px;color:#8b3a2b;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:16px"><%= e.company %></p><div style="font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.75;color:#333"><% const points = (e.description||'').split(/\n+/).filter(Boolean); %><ul style="padding-left:22px;margin:0"><% points.forEach(pt=>{ %> <li style="margin-bottom:8px"><%= pt.replace(/^[•\-\*]\s*/, '') %></li><% }) %></ul></div></article><% }) %></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="kicker">Academic Background</div><h2>Pendidikan</h2><div class="grid"><% (typeof education !== 'undefined' ? education : []).forEach(ed=>{ %><article class="card"><div class="meta"><%= ed.period %></div><h3><%= ed.title %></h3><p><strong><%= ed.institution %></strong></p><p class="muted"><%= ed.description %></p></article><% }) %></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="kicker">Leadership & Honors</div><h2>Organisasi & Prestasi</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><div class="meta">2023 – 2025</div><h3>Ketua & Wakil Ketua Divisi GDSC Ubhara Jaya</h3><p><strong>UKM Google Developer Students Club</strong></p><p class="muted">Memimpin divisi dan mengoordinasikan program kerja serta pengembangan kapasitas teknologi bagi 10+ anggota tim.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="meta">2023 – 2025</div><h3>Asisten Laboratorium Komputer FEB</h3><p><strong>Fakultas Ekonomi dan Bisnis Ubhara Jaya</strong></p><p class="muted">Mengelola administrasi dan praktikum untuk 8–9 mata kuliah dengan lebih dari 150+ mahasiswa per semester.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="meta">2023</div><h3>Juara 2 Business Case Competition</h3><p><strong>Festival Ekonomi Gemilang</strong></p><p class="muted">Kompetisi penyelesaian studi kasus bisnis strategis dan manajemen organisasi tingkat mahasiswa.</p></div></div></div></section></main><footer class="footer"><div class="container"><strong>Muhammad Julda Al Hafiz</strong><br>HR Generalist · From Numbers to Human Impact.</div></footer></body></html>